BT 1 0 0 1 0 99.5 Tm 12 TL /F1 8.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (\177 Revenue and absolute profit increased in each of the three financial years.) Tj  T* (\177 Revenue exceeded the annual budget in all three years and achieved 103.22% overall.) Tj  T* (\177 Revenue growth slowed from 16.58% to 8.69% in FY 2025\22626.) Tj  T* (\177 Profit margins peaked in FY 2024\22625 and declined slightly in FY 2025\22626.) Tj  T* (\177 Operating expense ratio improved from 23.77% to 23.01%.) Tj  T* (\177 Net cash flow remained positive in every financial year and totalled ) Tj /F3 8.5 Tf 12 TL (n) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf 12 TL (6.68 crore.) Tj  T* (\177 Revenue and COGS have a very strong positive association \(correlation 0.98\).) Tj  T* (\177 The t-test found evidence that average monthly net profit exceeded the selected ) Tj /F3 8.5 Tf 12 TL (n) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf 12 TL (10 lakh benchmark, subject to assumptions.) Tj  T* (\177 The operating-expense budget field requires clarification.) Tj T* ET
