BT 1 0 0 1 0 75.5 Tm 12 TL /F1 8.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (\177 Investigate the slowdown in revenue growth during FY 2025\22626, especially weaker months identified in the budget analysis.) Tj  T* (\177 Review product pricing, purchasing costs and sales mix to understand the slight decline in gross margin.) Tj  T* (\177 Continue monitoring operating expenses as a percentage of revenue.) Tj  T* (\177 Analyse the gap between accounting profit and net cash flow using detailed working-capital, receivables, inventory and) Tj T* (payables information.) Tj  T* (\177 Clarify the definition and construction of operating_expenses_budget_inr before using it for budget-versus-actual reporting.) Tj  T* (\177 Extend the dataset with product, customer, channel and transaction-level information to investigate monthly fluctuations.) Tj T* ET
