BT 1 0 0 1 0 75.5 Tm 12 TL /F1 8.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (\177 The dataset is fictional and contains 36 monthly observations only.) Tj  T* (\177 It lacks detailed product, customer, sales-volume, pricing and working-capital information; therefore, causes of changes cannot) Tj T* (be established.) Tj  T* (\177 Correlation and regression describe relationships and do not establish causation.) Tj  T* (\177 Consecutive monthly observations may exhibit time dependence or seasonality, which can affect statistical test assumptions.) Tj  T* (\177 The operating-expense budget field appears inconsistent and was not used for a direct OPEX budget comparison.) Tj  T* (\177 The regression model is based on the historical sample and is not a validated forecasting model.) Tj T* ET
