BT 1 0 0 1 0 39.5 Tm /F1 8.5 Tf 12 TL (This project demonstrates how Python can be used to prepare financial data, calculate business KPIs, analyse performance) Tj T* (over time, apply statistical methods and communicate findings through charts and a structured report. The fictional company) Tj T* (shows consistent growth in revenue and absolute profit, positive net cash flow and revenue-budget achievement above 100%.) Tj T* (At the same time, slower growth and slightly lower margins in FY 2025\22626 indicate areas management should monitor.) Tj T* ET
